[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201742427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-3201742427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":3201742427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-1rZb","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T18:20:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T18:36:30Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.beta 28bd72a7e on Linux:\n\n> Godot v4.5.beta (28bd72a7e) - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 575.64.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\nI've tested this with both input accumulation enabled and disabled (`Input.use_accumulated_input` in the root script's `_ready()` function). When set to `false`, the Inputs seen count is always 65, but the test will still fail under similar conditions.\n\nNote that even wiggling the mouse on the project window while it's running (without clicking) is enough to make it consistently fail:\n\n```\nInputs replayed  : 65\nInputs seen count: 63     <-- Will sometimes be 62 instead\nNot all expected inputs seen!\n```\n\nMashing non-movement keys like <kbd>U</kbd>/<kbd>I</kbd>/<kbd>O</kbd>/<kbd>P</kbd> will also cause it to fail most of the time, even though it'll see 65 inputs:\n\n<img width=\"641\" height=\"237\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db10b683-842c-4f3f-a78e-fcc34cad15e2\" />\n\nIf you do nothing, it'll always succeed. Spamming the mouse clicks and wheel doesn't seem to impact it either, probably because I'm not doing it fast enough compared to keyboard mashing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3201742427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3204054851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-3204054851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":3204054851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6--f9D","user":{"login":"Rubonnek","id":8337880,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMzc4ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8337880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek","html_url":"https://github.com/Rubonnek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T03:26:41Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T03:26:41Z","body":"> Note that even wiggling the mouse on the project window while it's running (without clicking) is enough to make it consistently fail:\n\nInteresting. I've not been able to reproduce the issue that way.\n\nI'll add I also tried replacing `_physics_process` with `_process`  in `Actor.gd` and  `_process` also seems to get skipped when toggling the window focus as well.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3204054851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464481606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-5464481606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":5464481606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRbVfRg","user":{"login":"ravenblackx","id":1923229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjMyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1923229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx","html_url":"https://github.com/ravenblackx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T19:46:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T19:47:09Z","body":"Possibly related, a thing I found while testing some networking behavior, a window that's hidden behind another window (maybe also if minimized) only does _process and _physics_process about once per second. My test case was clicking \"connect\" on my small window in front, then clicking \"connect\" on the larger window, bringing it to the front; the larger window then does its _process on the expected 17ms thresholds while the now-hidden window has 1s gaps between _process calls. With _physics_process the gaps may have been a bit smaller, it seemed to be 800-ish ms rather than the full second, but still much higher than expected.\n\nIt's not just about focus in my case - if I put the smaller window to one side so it's not covered by the larger window after the second \"connect\", but is still unfocused, the 17ms turnaround works as expected.\n\nVersion info: v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf] (on linux)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464481606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464589380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-5464589380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":5464589380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRbcERA","user":{"login":"Rubonnek","id":8337880,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMzc4ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8337880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek","html_url":"https://github.com/Rubonnek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rubonnek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T20:01:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T20:01:33Z","body":"@ravenblackx Any chance you could provide an MRP? Or perhaps test with headless mode (i.e. `godot --headless`) and check if the increased latency still happens? Also, are you using Wayland or X11?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464589380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464901443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-5464901443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":5464901443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRbvHQw","user":{"login":"ravenblackx","id":1923229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjMyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1923229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx","html_url":"https://github.com/ravenblackx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T21:09:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T21:09:46Z","body":"Oh no, turns out it's one of those heisenbugs - I thought it would repro with only what I described, but nope, tried it with a new project and no repro. Meanwhile I can consistently reproduce it by doing the same actions in my actual project, using this:\n```\nvar last_t: float = 0\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar t: float = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\n\tif t - last_t > 0.1:\n\t\tprint(\"delayed _process: \", t - last_t)\n\tlast_t = t\n\tfor c: Callable in _pollables:\n\t\tc.call()\n```\n\nMaybe there's some malinteraction with `HTTPClient.poll` or the webrtc connection's `poll`, that makes one of those blocking when the window is obscured. I'll dig a little deeper.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5464901443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5465111983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109759#issuecomment-5465111983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109759","id":5465111983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRb79rw","user":{"login":"ravenblackx","id":1923229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjMyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1923229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx","html_url":"https://github.com/ravenblackx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravenblackx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T21:56:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T21:58:12Z","body":"Aha, I got it - it's gl_renderer with vsync *and* requires that frames be actually rendering something *and* requires that the window be fully obscured (minimizing doesn't provoke it) - when that combination is present, the renderer blocks the thread for a second, so _process doesn't get called.\n\nRepro by covering one of the windows within ten seconds of running, in this project. (The debug output prints when the effect happens.)\n\n[low-process.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31604764/low-process.tar.gz)\n\n(Using wayland.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5465111983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]